    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "we route every reaction through one bundle per run per person, not one\n> message per skill — a person should get one thing to read, not four" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Tina pushed back on the batching window and Tanya held: the bundle closes when\nthe run closes, and a skill that misses the close waits for the next run rather\nthan sending on its own." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The alternative considered and rejected was per-skill\ndelivery with client-side collapsing, which moves the ordering problem onto the\nreader." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "the per-run bundle stays, and on Fridays we add one roll-up of the week —\n> what moved, what is still open — instead of asking anyone to scroll back" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Tanya held that it\ndoes not: the bundle is for the run, the roll-up is for the week." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Rejected: a\ndaily digest, because most days carry a single run and it would repeat the\nbundle word for word." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Testing that omitted ref creates a topic branch." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tina's pushback on the batching window is recorded inside the ruling children — the boundary was contested, not accepted outright." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Two rejected alternatives sit alongside the mainline: per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing, and a daily digest — both recorded with reasons, both live as roads not taken." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The two registers pull against each other: the flat repeated assertion never engages the delivery-routing rulings, and the rulings never reference the assertion — the hub holds both without reconciling them." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "splits by register — flat claim-level assertion in the daily spine, firm decision-conviction when ruling as owner" ; narr:text "Tanya (team owner) ruled on where reaction delivery belongs:" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "temporal" ; narr:reading "concrete-present-realis by default, shifting to abstract-future-irrealis exactly when stating the rule as policy" ; narr:text "we route every reaction through one bundle per run per person, not one\n> message per skill — a person should get one thing to read, not four" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "power" ; narr:reading "legitimate authority as the base move, with rational-persuasion layered on when she gives the reason for a rule" ; narr:text "Rejected: a\ndaily digest, because most days carry a single run and it would repeat the\nbundle word for word." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "relational" ; narr:reading "authority-ranking when holding a line, with a communal-sharing note when the rule serves the reader rather than the hierarchy" ; narr:text "the per-run bundle stays, and on Fridays we add one roll-up of the week —\n> what moved, what is still open — instead of asking anyone to scroll back" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "antithesis-plus-parallelism is her signature move — the rule is always stated as what it is not" ; narr:text "Tanya held that it\ndoes not: the bundle is for the run, the roll-up is for the week." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "value" ; narr:reading "consistently self-transcendence — every ruling is justified by what the reader should not have to carry" ; narr:text "The alternative considered and rejected was per-skill\ndelivery with client-side collapsing, which moves the ordering problem onto the\nreader." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "plain-spoken when issuing the rule, technical when recording what was rejected, formal in the quote frames" ; narr:text "Tanya (team owner) ruled on how the week's reactions reach people:" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_1> ] ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
